{"id":"17B","title":"Envy","part":{"n":17,"title":"Personal character traits"},"url":"/law/17-personal-character-traits/17b","entries":[{"id":"17B.1","text":"We are not to be envious of one another.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":3,"verses":"31"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":1,"verses":"28-29"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":13,"verses":"13"},{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":12,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Galatians","chapter":5,"verses":"26"}],"citation":"Prov. 3:31; Rom. 1:28-29; Rom. 13:13; 2 Cor. 12:20; Gal. 5:26,"},{"id":"17B.2","text":"Lay aside all envy.","refs":[{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":2,"verses":"1"}],"citation":"1 Pet. 2:1."},{"id":"17B.3","text":"Envy is a work of the flesh.","refs":[{"book":"Galatians","chapter":5,"verses":"19,21"},{"book":"James","chapter":4,"verses":"5"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":3,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"Gal. 5:19, 21; James 4:5; Cor. 3:3."},{"id":"17B.4","text":"It is vain to be envious of the good deeds of other.","refs":[{"book":"Ecclesiastes","chapter":4,"verses":"4"}],"citation":"Eccl. 4:4."},{"id":"17B.5","text":"Where envy and self-ambition exist, there will be confusion and every evil thing.","refs":[{"book":"James","chapter":3,"verses":"16"}],"citation":"James 3:16."},{"id":"17B.6","text":"Envy leads to hurt and punishment.","refs":[{"book":"Job","chapter":5,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":14,"verses":"30"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":106,"verses":"16-17"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":26,"verses":"11"}],"citation":"Job 5:2; Prov. 14:30; Psa. 106:16-17; Isa. 26:11."},{"id":"17B.7","text":"Envy leads to confusion and evil works.","refs":[{"book":"James","chapter":3,"verses":"14-16"}],"citation":"James 3:14-16."},{"id":"17B.8","text":"We are not to be envious of the prosperity of the wicked.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":37,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":73,"verses":"3"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":24,"verses":"1,19-20"}],"citation":"Psa. 37:1; Psa. 73:3; Prov. 24:1, 19-20."},{"id":"17B.9","text":"Let not your heart envy sinners, nor be envious of the workers of iniquity.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":37,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":23,"verses":"17"}],"citation":"Psa. 37:1; Prov. 23:17."},{"id":"17B.10","text":"If you have bitter envy and self ambition in your hearts, do not boast and lie against the truth.","refs":[{"book":"James","chapter":3,"verses":"14"}],"citation":"James 3:14."},{"id":"17B.11","text":"True love is not jealousy.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":13,"verses":"4"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 13:4."},{"id":"17B.12","text":"Do not envy those who oppress others.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":3,"verses":"31"}],"citation":"Prov. 3:31."}]}